1
00:00:01,840 --> 00:00:03,857
As Uke strikes the center of your head

2
00:00:04,158 --> 00:00:05,605
raise up to meet the strike,

3
00:00:05,906 --> 00:00:09,552
redirect the strike in a big circular movement
around the front of you,

4
00:00:09,853 --> 00:00:12,758
as Uke comes round step in under the arm,

5
00:00:12,759 --> 00:00:13,618
turn the body,

6
00:00:13,619 --> 00:00:17,194
turn, and place Uke down in front of you.

